msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完全な変更履歴"

msgid ""
"August is upon us but we are still steadily publishing new Quarkus releases.\n"
"Today, we released Quarkus 3.2.3.Final, the third maintenance release of our 3.2 release train."
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.2."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that this version upgrades Hibernate Search to 6.2\n"
"as we wanted to offer full support for Elasticsearch 8 in Quarkus 3.2.\n"
"If you are using Hibernate Search, have another look at the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2#hibernate-search[dedicated section of the 3.2 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are not already using 3.2, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[Quarkus 3.2 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "And if you are not already using 3.0, please refer to https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-final-released/[the Quarkus 3.0 announcement] and in particular the section about the https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-final-released/#upgrading[upgrade path to 3.0] together with the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.1[3.1 migration guide] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[Quarkus 3.2 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.2.3.Final[the full changelog of 3.2.3.Final] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.2.3.Final[the full changelog of 3.2.3.Final] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
